WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
A learner types a question, e.g. "How do I join two tables in SQL?"

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
A self-hosted n8n workflow catches the question through a webhook.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
An embedding model turns the question into a list of numbers (a vector).

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000
The vector database returns the course notes whose meaning is closest.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Those notes are added to the prompt, so the LLM answers from real material.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.000
The answer comes back grounded in the documents, with its sources cited.

